nerateTranscription/adapter.ts#L38)\n\n**`Internal`**\n\nType-only properties for inference. Not assigned at runtime.\n\n#### providerOptions\n\n```ts\nproviderOptions: TProviderOptions;\n```\n\n***\n\n### kind\n\n```ts\nreadonly kind: \"transcription\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts#L29)\n\nDiscriminator for adapter kind - used to determine API shape\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nreadonly model: TModel;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts:33](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts#L33)\n\nThe model this adapter is configured for\n\n***\n\n### name\n\n```ts\nreadonly name: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts:31](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts#L31)\n\nAdapter name identifier\n\n***\n\n### transcribe\n\n```ts\ntranscribe: (options) => Promise<TranscriptionResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts:45](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts#L45)\n\nTranscribe audio to text\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n[`TranscriptionOptions`](TranscriptionOptions.md)\\<`TProviderOptions`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`TranscriptionResult`](TranscriptionResult.md)\\>\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: TranscriptionAdapter\ntitle: TranscriptionAdapter\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts:24](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts#L24)\n\nTranscription adapter interface with pre-resolved generics.\n\nAn adapter is created by a provider function: `provider('model')` → `adapter`\nAll type resolution happens at the provider call site, not in this interface.\n\nGeneric parameters:\n- TModel: The specific model name (e.g., 'whisper-1')\n- TProviderOptions: Provider-specific options (already resolved)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TModel\n\n`TModel` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n### TProviderOptions\n\n`TProviderOptions` *extends* `object` = `Record`\\<`string`, `unknown`\\>\n\n## Properties\n\n### ~types\n\n```ts\n~types: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts:38](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts#L38)\n\n**`Internal`**\n\nType-only properties for inference. Not assigned at runtime.\n\n#### providerOptions\n\n```ts\nproviderOptions: TProviderOptions;\n```\n\n***\n\n### kind\n\n```ts\nreadonly kind: \"transcription\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts#L29)\n\nDiscriminator for adapter kind - used to determine API shape\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nreadonly model: TModel;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts:33](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts#L33)\n\nThe model this adapter is configured for\n\n***\n\n### name\n\n```ts\nreadonly name: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts:31](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts#L31)\n\nAdapter name identifier\n\n***\n\n### transcribe\n\n```ts\ntranscribe: (options) => Promise<TranscriptionResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts:45](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/adapter.ts#L45)\n\nTranscribe audio to text\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n[`TranscriptionOptions`](TranscriptionOptions.md)\\<`TProviderOptions`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`TranscriptionResult`](TranscriptionResult.md)\\>\n"}
